<title>GERMANY: Commerzbank declines comment on bid rumour.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank declines comment on bid rumour.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG declined comment on financial market rumours that the HongKong and Shanghai Banking Corp was planning to take it over.</p>
<p>A spokesman said it was the bank's usual practice not to comment on market speculation.</p>
<p>Renewed talk of a takeover boosted Commerzbank shares by around eight percent to 69.20 marks in computerised trading on Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
